            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 21 and 22</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> benefits of city bike-sharing schemes do the students agree are the most important?</p>",
