            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 23 and 24</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> things do the students think are necessary for successful bike-sharing schemes?</p>",
